# Build context for this Dockerfile is the repo root. Only patches/ is ever
# COPYed from it; the rest is documentation, host-side tooling, investigation
# output (ORT backend-test logs run tens of megabytes), and the entire
# rocm7.14/ and rocm6.4.4/ lines, none of which belongs in a context transfer.
#
# This does not affect layer caching: BuildKit keys a COPY on the checksums of
# the files it actually copies, not on the whole context.
*.md
*.log
tools/
rocm7.14/
rocm6.4.4/
llama-cpp-gfx803/